  </head>

  <body>
    <Header />

    <main>
      <div class="crumb">
        <div class="container">
          <a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span>
          <a href="/blog/">Blog</a><span>›</span>
          <span>JPSC Previous Year Papers</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="tag">JPSC PRELIMS • PYQ • QUESTION PAPERS</div>
          <h1>
            Don't Just Solve PYQs.
            <span>Decode Them.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="hero-text">
            Find JPSC Preliminary previous-year papers, learn how to use them
